docs {
  # Updates the specified failure detection parameter set | maturity=EARLY_ADOPTER

  If a set with the specified ID doesn't exist, a new one is created.

  **Auth:** Api-Token only (OAuth not supported by this endpoint). Uses `{{DT_API_TOKEN}}`.

  **API token scopes:** WriteConfig
}
